      "short": "$147\\pi\\text{ cm}^2$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\pi r^2&=49\\pi\\\\r^2&=49\\\\r&=7\\text{ cm}\\\\A&=3\\pi r^2\\\\A&=3\\pi(7)^2\\\\A&=147\\pi\\text{ cm}^2\\end{align*}$$",
